            "approvedDateTime": "2023-12-05T11:30:00-08:00",
            "noteText": "<h3>Diagnosis</h3><p>Stomach - severe, chronic-active, ulcerative and perforating gastritis with intralesional nematodes.</p><h3>Comments</h3><p>Consistent with the gross findings; no evidence of neoplasia.</p><h3>Liver</h3><p>Mild hepatic lipidosis.</p>"
